<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">October Diploma</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1860">1860</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The October Diploma was a constitutional decree issued by Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/franz-joseph-i">Franz Joseph I</a> on 20 October 1860, after defeat in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> had discredited neo-absolutism. It restored the provincial diets and created an imperial council with a federalist, aristocratic bent, but it satisfied neither Hungarians nor German liberals and was replaced by the centralist February Patent of 1861.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/october-diploma.jpg" alt="October Diploma" width="320" height="391" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Emil Rabending (1823-1886) · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Agenor_Go%C5%82uchowski_(senior).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
